phonedriver
=========

The on-device agent in android-agent/ contains source files copied from scrcpy
(https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy, commit a60891a), which is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).
Copyright (C) 2018 Genymobile. Copyright (C) 2018-2026 Romain Vimont.

The files keep scrcpy's package names and paths. Files marked "modified" differ from
upstream; the others are unchanged.

