The video encoder settings (android-agent/src/dev/phonedriver/agent/Video.java) follow
scrcpy's video/SurfaceEncoder.java; the gesture player and control server are new code.

phonedriver includes material derived from the following projects.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WebDriverAgent
https://github.com/appium/WebDriverAgent at 3d6a4e0

Files: ios-runner/PrivateHeaders/XCTestPrivate.h, which declares a subset of the
private XCTest interfaces found in WebDriverAgent's PrivateHeaders/XCTest/
XCSynthesizedEventRecord.h, XCPointerEventPath.h, XCUIDevice.h, XCAXClient_iOS.h,
XCUIApplicationProcessTracker-Protocol.h, XCUIApplication.h and
WebDriverAgentLib/Routing/FBXCElementSnapshot.h.

